Provide one serialized owner for the firmware DDR low-power service, expose a
documented policy control, and let ISP capture hold a performance constraint
without changing the user's selected policy.  The service is inert until a
policy or kernel client requests a transition and fails closed when firmware
does not implement the SiP call.

