+
+		firmware
+			Permit the firmware-programmed DDR low-power controls.
+			This is the default and does not imply that firmware has
+			enabled every available low-power mode.
+
+		performance
+			Inhibit DDR low-power entry through the CIX SiP service.
+
+		Kernel clients may temporarily override firmware policy when
+		they require deterministic DDR service. Such an override does
+		not change the selected policy.
+
+What:		/sys/firmware/cix/ddr_low_power/effective_policy
+Date:		July 2026
